<title>UK: BayerVB sets C$100 million December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets C$100 million December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    29.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.2275  PAY DATE  S 14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.04     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT 1999 CANADA</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
